      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>::Emergency buzzers. Plug it in and play back the sounds it asks for. Three sequences in a row without a mistake. Colors of progression - red, green, blue, I think... If fail, start over.&lt;end&gt;</source>
